      "description": "The standard white pill in Google's own grammar; never re-skinned.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-gbtn\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" class=\"ds-g-icon\"><path fill=\"#EA4335\" d=\"M24 9.75c3.23 0 6.13 1.11 8.41 3.29l6.31-6.31C34.91 3.18 29.93 1 24 1 14.4 1 6.04 6.93 2.42 15.12l9.27 5.7C13.42 15.62 18.15 9.75 24 9.75z\"/><path fill=\"#4285F4\" d=\"M45.12 24.5c0-1.56-.14-3.06-.4-4.5H24v8.51h11.84c-.51 2.75-2.06 5.08-4.39 6.64v5.52h7.11c4.16-3.83 6.56-9.47 6.56-16.17z\"/><path fill=\"#FBBC05\" d=\"M11.69 28.18C11.25 26.86 11 25.45 11 24s.25-2.86.69-4.18v-5.7H2.42C.88 17.09 0 20.45 0 24s.88 6.91 2.42 9.88l9.27-5.7z\"/><path fill=\"#34A853\" d=\"M24 47c5.94 0 10.92-1.97 14.56-5.33l-7.11-5.52c-1.97 1.32-4.49 2.1-7.45 2.1-5.73 0-10.58-3.87-12.31-9.07H2.42v5.7C6.04 41.07 14.4 47 24 47z\"/></svg><span>Continue with Google</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-gbtn{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:12px;width:300px;height:50px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:#22252a;border:1px solid #c9ccd2;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(34,37,42,.08);font-family:'Karla Variable','Karla',sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 120ms ease-out,transform 90ms ease-out}.ds-gbtn:hover{background:#f6f2e9}.ds-gbtn:active{transform:translateY(1px)}.ds-gbtn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #22252a;outline-offset:2px}.ds-gbtn:disabled{cursor:progress;opacity:.7}.ds-gicon{width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Week Panel",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "week-panel",
      "description": "Signature component: ruled 7-column week strip, Monday-first, weekend tint.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-week\"><div class=\"ds-day\"><span class=\"ds-lbl\">Mon</span></div><div class=\"ds-day\"><span class=\"ds-lbl\">Tue</span><span class=\"ds-chip ds-c-blue\">Swim</span></div><div class=\"ds-day\"><span class=\"ds-lbl\">Wed</span></div><div class=\"ds-day\"><span class=\"ds-lbl\">Thu</span><span class=\"ds-chip ds-c-green\">Dent.</span></div><div class=\"ds-day\"><span class=\"ds-lbl\">Fri</span></div><div class=\"ds-day\"><span class=\"ds-lbl\">Sat</span><span class=\"ds-chip ds-c-yellow\">Oma</span></div><div class=\"ds-day ds-weekend\"><span class=\"ds-lbl\">Sun</span></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-week{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);border:2px solid #22252a;border-radius:4px;height:150px}.ds-day{position:relative;border-right:1px solid rgba(34,37,42,.35)}.ds-day:last-child{border-right:none}.ds-weekend{background:rgba(208,80,64,.07)}.ds-lbl{position:absolute;top:10px;width:100%;text-align:center;font-family:'Permanent Marker',cursive;font-size:13px;color:#22252a}"
